{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A favorite nonogram puzzle game for over 16 years, Pixelogic is finally making its way to Steam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelogic is a challenging yet chill nonogram game (a.k.a. picross, griddlers, or paint-by-numbers) where you use numeric clues to uncover a hidden picture. No cartoon characters or gimmicks, just pure puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Logic to Reveal a Hidden Picture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a combination of sudoku and mine sweeper, use numeric clues and deductive reasoning to reveal a hidden picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/2d09c3ffbd09cfeacc4e1b6714082f53.poster.avif?t=1759272686\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/2d09c3ffbd09cfeacc4e1b6714082f53.webm?t=1759272686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/2d09c3ffbd09cfeacc4e1b6714082f53.mp4?t=1759272686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6,000+ Human-Made Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited access to 16+ years of past daily and weekly puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/665f844f8b0969620e2a529a468b18bc.poster.avif?t=1759272686\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/665f844f8b0969620e2a529a468b18bc.webm?t=1759272686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/665f844f8b0969620e2a529a468b18bc.mp4?t=1759272686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Two new puzzles each day + an extra large  puzzle each week</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50  Unlimited access to back catalog of 6,000+ past daily puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50  Choose your challenge from Easy (5x5) to Expert (25x25)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Know where you rank with worldwide statistics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Create and share your own puzzles with included full-featured puzzle creator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Dark mode, themes, &amp; customize colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Play how you want: mouse, keyboard, touch or gamepad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Steam deck support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection required for daily featured puzzles and featured puzzle archive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677530?t=1759272686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677530?t=1759272686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/1dd95c8eca6cfebafbead40f39952359ed22c6b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759272686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/1dd95c8eca6cfebafbead40f39952359ed22c6b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759272686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3974250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A favorite nonogram puzzle game for over 16 years, Pixelogic is finally making